<title>FINLAND: VAPO 1996 OPERATING PROFIT UP TO FIM 186 MLN.</title>
<headline>VAPO 1996 OPERATING PROFIT UP TO FIM 186 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit					   120 vs 114</p>
<p> Operating profit				   186 vs 182</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 293 vs 289</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,645 vs 1,535</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    59.6 vs 55.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish state-owned peat group is Vapo</p>
<p>Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
